00:01:06.974 --> 00:01:07.807
Well, that's me.

00:01:07.807 --> 00:01:08.640
- I'm excited, though.

00:01:08.640 --> 00:01:09.473
Are you excited about 40?

00:01:09.473 --> 00:01:10.306
I am.

00:01:10.306 --> 00:01:11.139
- I am excited about it.

00:01:11.139 --> 00:01:12.604
I know that it's like a major-

00:01:12.604 --> 00:01:13.639
Like, to be 40-

00:01:13.639 --> 00:01:16.065
It's so crazy because 40s like-

